<h2 dir="auto">Paper Title:</h2>
<p dir="auto">B4: Experience with a Globally-Deployed Software Defined WAN</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Paper Year:</h3>
<p dir="auto">2013</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Reasons for including paper</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>This paper was likely the first large demonstration of SDN networks in industry.</li>
